te-on-femicide-and-the-social-accept/a-79681977--0dbaaaebbc74.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/the-murder-of-a-young-mother-in-iran-has-once-again-sparked-debate-on-femicide-and-the-social-acceptance-of-violence-against-women/a-79681977?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The murder of a young mother has once again sparked debate in Iran over so-called honor killings, the social acceptance of violence against women and the lack of protection for people vulnerable to gender-based violence.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
